<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-10T01:41:02.579Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 01:41:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran-linked drones attacked the Khor Mor gas field in Iraqi Kurdistan, halting production and cutting about 2.8 GW of power. Iraqi forces carried out airstrikes on three suspected militants and a tunnel in Kirkuk’s Zghaitun Valley. Baghdad is negotiating with armed groups and has agreed to reopen the Sheeb border while Turkish forces will withdraw from the Zilkan base by the end of 2026. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to its report.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxQRjlSd2FrSzRhU0tEbmROLW4tVVFKdVM2WnU5dzgwb1RJRkpTTUM4RV9ES3Q0cTZFSmFYaXZKalpUbVhZcDEyckNsWC1JV3E4QXlsVXBxSVM5RHlXZ1Z2Z21jMU1HMzg4Q1RxNm9sQ3JmWGsyUDBPQURDdVpxYzFscXJiOXNxSFl4MDZVTU0xQ3NGYTJoeUFGSWhKZTV1bjdGUWJlSTNueDRwbGdzMlZXZVpJUDA3c2Q5RVlndS1zU3JaeDJzd1BzeDNB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;VOA - Voice of America English News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE0wU05Za1hqbXN5ZjNMdTNtbXZhdUVBd1VfR0llWmVKUy1MX3lyNGsxT2NfbkgtT055XzVua3JBNE9FVXM5cEkzU2M3YU1ERVduemI4Q2U3UGVOd2V6?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTE5PZnpQZXNKY0xfRnZhSEU2MDdIWVgtUkVRbXJrQjNJWWkyekNaLU96Y2ZQNmg4eVI3ZzF2a3RDWFh1OXZvemZTU2V1c3VfYlpOVnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Iran International&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxOWXhVekk3NDN6blIwbmtMOG4zaHpwRm9zNlBaR1poTjdQUlZhZ0J5YnVTRm9ZejZOU19DdTRPa21jU1h3RWFjWlUtVlprZzVVTXZfN2Q3LVJPYXhIdXBIcFRMMm1fTElfcFFHWTFSM0hOLWktUFl5bEZaeU5zYjdNMThtdGliQlZsaEs0VzFxVXBJOUtrNkZEMmZZamMzMWhRN1hrQW1DX0JIdVhyMjNxc1dR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Re